# ── Ultron — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# a LINKED WhatsApp session
config/whatsapp_web/
**/token*.json
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db
# Workspace conversations, saved results, activity and provider caches
config/workspace/

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# Local audit checkouts, recovery snapshots and personal runtime state
.audit/
backups/
telegram_temp/
audio_state.json
last_movie_results.json
vosk_model/
vosk_model.zip
node_modules/

# User-bound integration credentials and private provider state
config/integrations/

# Account status, preferences and temporary credential writes
config/*.json
config/*.tmp
!config/*.example.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/*credentials*.json.*
**/client_secret*.json*
**/token*.json*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.session
**/*.session-journal
.claude/
.codex/
.mcp.json

# Personal activity and generated work
memory/*.json
memory/*.json.*
memory/*.sqlite*
audio_aliases.json
Projects/*/db/
Projects/*/cache/
Projects/*/generated_sites/
Projects/*/omni_done.mp3
assets/holo/state/
assets/holo/holo.json
test_audio.wav
podesavanja.txt
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp

# Speech-recognition diagnostics can contain transcripts
vosk_log.txt
